      "tailOutIdx": 1,
      "category": "img2img",
      "isInpaint": false,
      "description": "【图片生成】\n关键节点：加载 VAE（加载 VAE 模型「潜空间 ↔ 像素空间的编解码」）；加载扩散模型（加载 UNet/DiT 扩散主干模型「生成的核心权重」）；加载 CLIP（加载文本编码器 CLIP 模型「把提示词编码成条件」）；VAE 解码（把潜空间 latent 解码回像素图像）；采样器（用模型 + 正负条件去噪采样，生成图片）；加载 LoRA（仅模型）（加载 LoRA 微调权重，只改扩散模型、不改 CLIP）；…（共 14 个）。\n核心模型：VAE qwen_image_vae.safetensors / UNet krea-2-turbo.safetensors / CLIP qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors。\n输入：参考图。\n输出：图片。\n可调参数：提示词输入（描述你想生成的画面）、批次数、用户设置。",
      "paramNodes": [
        {
          "nodeId": "1",
          "nodeType": "VAELoader",
          "title": "VAELoader",
          "desc": "加载 VAE 模型（潜空间 ↔ 像素空间的编解码）。"
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "33",
          "nodeType": "Krea2OstrisEditModelPatch",
          "title": "Krea2OstrisEditModelPatch",
          "desc": "Enable reference latents on a Krea 2 model (index_timestep_zero method, as trained by ai-toolkit). Chain conditioning from TextEncodeKrea2OstrisEdit or Set Reference Latent nodes. kv_cache enables the cached one-pass reference mode; the LoRA must be trained with ai-toolkit's kv_cache option for it to work properly."
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "2",
          "nodeType": "UNETLoader",
          "title": "UNETLoader",
          "desc": "加载 UNet/DiT 扩散主干模型（生成的核心权重）。"
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "3",
          "nodeType": "CLIPLoader",
          "title": "CLIPLoader",
          "desc": "加载文本编码器 CLIP 模型（把提示词编码成条件）。"
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "8",
          "nodeType": "VAEDecode",
          "title": "VAEDecode",
          "desc": "把潜空间 latent 解码回像素图像。"
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "7",
          "nodeType": "KSampler",
          "title": "KSampler",
